# Models are downloaded here at runtime by scripts/download_models.sh
# (YuNet + SFace from the OpenCV Zoo, SHA-256 pinned). They are intentionally
# NOT committed (see .gitignore). At runtime the daemon reads models from
# ~/.local/share/facelock/models by default; download_models.sh populates both
# this directory (for a repo-local run) and the data dir (for the installed run).
